---
// カテゴリページへのリンクを並べる（一覧・カテゴリページの上）。横スクロールにせず折り返す
import CategoryIcon from './CategoryIcon.astro';
import { categories } from '../lib/data';
import { type Lang, categoryName, localePath } from '../lib/i18n';
interface Props { current?: string; lang?: Lang }
const { current, lang = 'ja' } = Astro.props;
---
<nav class="cat-links" aria-labelledby="cat-links-label">
  <span id="cat-links-label" class="filter-label">{lang === 'en' ? 'Categories' : 'カテゴリ'}</span>
  {categories.map((c) => (
    <a class="cat-chip" href={localePath(lang, `/category/${c.slug}/`)} aria-current={c.slug === current ? 'page' : undefined}>
      <CategoryIcon slug={c.slug} />{categoryName(c.slug, lang)}
    </a>
  ))}
</nav>
